{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abbess Garden is a third-person gardening game set in an abandoned abbey of Port-Royal-des-Champs, in the heart of France.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 1643, and you play as Agn\u00e8s, a young peasant at the centre of a spy intrigue.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/1a6798c65e70924f0bb63a5310f6c54a.webp?t=1764672235\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/745368ae148475d5845af9b1d49ccba6.poster.avif?t=1764672235\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/745368ae148475d5845af9b1d49ccba6.webm?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/745368ae148475d5845af9b1d49ccba6.mp4?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nurture the Abbess' garden using gardening techniques based on real horticulture.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, water them and take their soil and proximity preferences into account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it\u2019s the right time, gather more seeds, flowers, roots and leaves for botany and medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/ef59337f019afd0b89475658991654c0.webp?t=1764672235\" width=600 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/f796ee381fb6e9286ca4b91116d9ceb5.poster.avif?t=1764672235\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/f796ee381fb6e9286ca4b91116d9ceb5.webm?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/f796ee381fb6e9286ca4b91116d9ceb5.mp4?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>The abbey harbours many secrets and wonders of years long gone. It is now used by the mysterious Solitaires taking their lodging in the area. But one place remains forbidden to them.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The Abbess gave to you, Agn\u00e8s, the keys to her personal and majestic garden. You have been tasked to restore the holy place. Yet more than just ragworts and critters  hide in the weeds\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a book written by a deceased spy, help the local community understand it before the British and French royals do and find love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/2498031193465d3518390b8cc87baae5.webp?t=1764672235\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/70d3f2013ffc44bfe3779c3b3b78e373.poster.avif?t=1764672235\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/70d3f2013ffc44bfe3779c3b3b78e373.webm?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/70d3f2013ffc44bfe3779c3b3b78e373.mp4?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and identify all plants at all their evolution stages as you explore the garden, through the changing seasons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hidden objects in the garden. Finding them will fulfil your collections, trigger new quests and dialogues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new parts of your garden as you progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/200da519dbbf98ccc3546b62e42ed18e.webp?t=1764672235\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add The Abbess Garden to your wishlist, follow us, and join our Discord or newsletter so you don't miss any news!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411970?t=1764672235","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411970?t=1764672235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/c13b7121a9007ac11092b8e4b6ba7d6afbe91241/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764672235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/c13b7121a9007ac11092b8e4b6ba7d6afbe91241/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764672235","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3873090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abbess Garden is a third-person gardening game set in an abandoned abbey of Port-Royal-des-Champs, in the heart of France.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 1643, and you play as Agn\u00e8s, a young peasant at the centre of a spy intrigue.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/1a6798c65e70924f0bb63a5310f6c54a.webp?t=1764672235\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/745368ae148475d5845af9b1d49ccba6.poster.avif?t=1764672235\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/745368ae148475d5845af9b1d49ccba6.webm?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/745368ae148475d5845af9b1d49ccba6.mp4?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nurture the Abbess' garden using gardening techniques based on real horticulture.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant seeds, water them and take their soil and proximity preferences into account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it\u2019s the right time, gather more seeds, flowers, roots and leaves for botany and medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/ef59337f019afd0b89475658991654c0.webp?t=1764672235\" width=600 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/f796ee381fb6e9286ca4b91116d9ceb5.poster.avif?t=1764672235\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/f796ee381fb6e9286ca4b91116d9ceb5.webm?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/f796ee381fb6e9286ca4b91116d9ceb5.mp4?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>The abbey harbours many secrets and wonders of years long gone. It is now used by the mysterious Solitaires taking their lodging in the area. But one place remains forbidden to them.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The Abbess gave to you, Agn\u00e8s, the keys to her personal and majestic garden. You have been tasked to restore the holy place. Yet more than just ragworts and critters  hide in the weeds\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a book written by a deceased spy, help the local community understand it before the British and French royals do and find love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/2498031193465d3518390b8cc87baae5.webp?t=1764672235\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/70d3f2013ffc44bfe3779c3b3b78e373.poster.avif?t=1764672235\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/70d3f2013ffc44bfe3779c3b3b78e373.webm?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/70d3f2013ffc44bfe3779c3b3b78e373.mp4?t=1764672235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and identify all plants at all their evolution stages as you explore the garden, through the changing seasons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hidden objects in the garden. Finding them will fulfil your collections, trigger new quests and dialogues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new parts of your garden as you progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/200da519dbbf98ccc3546b62e42ed18e.webp?t=1764672235\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add The Abbess Garden to your wishlist, follow us, and join our Discord or newsletter so you don't miss any news!</p>","developers":["MD Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/header.jpg?t=1764672235","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3411970/961059830/732b1861b717632ba6b97bb9510725cabdac4e2c/1760128478/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760129008","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3411970/961059830/732b1861b717632ba6b97bb9510725cabdac4e2c/1760128478/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760129008","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3411970/961059830/732b1861b717632ba6b97bb9510725cabdac4e2c/1760128478/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760129008","id":257100458,"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100458/